<title>JAPAN: Nissan 1996 domestic output down 6.0% y/y.</title>
<headline>Nissan 1996 domestic output down 6.0% y/y.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nissan Motor Co Ltd said on Monday its domestic vehicle production, exports, domestic sales and overseas output in calendar 1996 were as follows:</p>
<p> Production	  1,610,542   down 6.0 percent</p>
<p>  - Car		1,409,127   down 6.6 percent</p>
<p>  - Truck &amp; Bus	201,415   down 1.8 percent</p>
<p> Domestic sales    1,116,643   up  0.1 percent</p>
<p>  - Car		  813,675 down  1.8 percent</p>
<p>  - Truck &amp; Bus	302,968   up  5.4 percent</p>
<p> Exports		 581,854 down  2.7 percent</p>
<p>  - Cars		 506,563 down  3.3 percent</p>
<p>  - Truck &amp; Bus	 75,291   up  1.7 percent</p>
<p> Overseas output   1,064,579 down  0.6 percent</p>
<p>Nissan's those statistics in December were as follows:</p>
<p> Production	    131,763 down  3.1 percent</p>
<p>  - Car		  117,183 down  1.8 percent</p>
<p>  - Truck &amp; Bus	 14,580 down 12.8 percent</p>
<p> Domestic sales	 75,243   up  2.0 percent</p>
<p>  - Car		   55,152   up  4.1 percent</p>
<p>  - Truck &amp; Bus	 20,091 down  3.4 percent</p>
<p> Exports		  52,680   up  7.3 percent</p>
<p>  - Cars		  46,161   up  7.6 percent</p>
<p>  - Truck &amp; Bus	  6,519   up  5.2 percent</p>
<p> Overseas output	71,542   up  7.1 percent</p>
</text>
